    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="J21nB109-start">
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a0501.s34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">Not reaching its principle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1301.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">*Yǒngjiā* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1301.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">"Walking is also *chán*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1301.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">sitting is also *chán*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1301.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">Speaking, silence, movement, stillness—the body is at ease.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1301.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">Even encountering sharp blades, one is always composed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1301.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">Even facing poison, one is carefree."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1301.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a15.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">The *Bōrě* Chapter</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a16.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">clearly illuminates the emptiness of the five aggregates.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a16.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">Clearly, one can transcend all suffering.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">The *Bōrěbōluómìduō Xīnjīng* (Heart Sutra) states:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">"When the Bodhisattva Avalokiteśvara practices the profound *prajnaparamita*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">he illuminates and sees that the five aggregates are empty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">and transcends all suffering and distress.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">Śāriputra!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">Form is not different from emptiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">emptiness is not different from form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">form is precisely emptiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">emptiness is precisely form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">sensation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">perception,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">volition,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">consciousness are also like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">Śāriputra!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">All dharmas are marked by emptiness; they are not produced,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">not destroyed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">not defiled,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">not pure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">not increasing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">not decreasing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">Therefore, in emptiness, there is no form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">no sensation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">perception,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">volition,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">consciousness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">no eye,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J21nB109_CBETA_3-0485a1701.s27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T13:41:33.982+09:00">ear,</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
